  "company": "voltmarkt",
  "schema": "voltmarkt",
  "edge_schema": "voltmarkt_edge_win",
  "prompt": "The TV & Video buyers are preparing a range review and want each category's best sellers of the first half of 2025. Use the sales rows whose parent_category is 'TV & Video' and whose order_date falls from 1 January 2025 to 30 June 2025, both days included. A product's revenue is the total net_revenue_eur of its rows in that period; only products with at least one such row count. Within each category (category_name), rank the products by revenue from the highest down, and keep the products ranked 1 to 3. Products that tie on revenue share the same place, and the place after a tie is skipped: two products tied for first are both 1 and the next product is 3, and a tie for third keeps every tied product. Return six columns, in this order: category_name; product_id; product_name; revenue_eur, the product's revenue; category_share_pct, the product's revenue as a percentage of the revenue of all the products of its category in that period (every product counted, not only the top 3), rounded to 1 decimal; and revenue_rank, the product's place. Sort by category_name from A to Z, then by revenue_rank from low to high, then by product_id from low to high.",
  "output_contract": {
